.TH SECRANDOM-LITE 1 "2026-11-08" "SecRandom Lite" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
secrandom-lite \- random roll-call application for classrooms
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B secrandom-lite
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B SecRandom Lite
is a Material Design 3 random roll-call and student picker for classroom use.
It supports student lists, several fair-draw modes, roll-call history,
data import and export, and optional cloud sync.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/SECTL/SecRandom-Lite
